  "bodyHash": "MLviq19yek8=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>营火出生点与调整模组新增了在营火中设置出生点的能力，并对该方块的相关机制进行了一些调整。默认情况下，重生后你将获得10秒的防火效果，并出现在营火上方。该功能在主世界、下界和末地均可生效，同时也适用于模组添加的维度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span><strong>默认配置下的功能：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>营火初始为熄灭状态。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>点燃营火会在其上方创建一个出生点。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>使用沙子、泥土或灵魂沙右键点击营火可将其熄灭。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>使用打火石右键点击含水的营火可去除其含水状态。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>防止点击营火侧面时在相邻方块上放置火。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>若玩家在营火内部重生，将获得10秒的防火效果。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>如果重生时营火上方有方块，则会创建一个两格高的空气空间。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>潜行+右键点击床会覆盖营火设置的出生点。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>潜行+右键点击营火会移除该出生点。或者在点燃营火时执行相同操作，以防止设置出生点。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，新放置的营火将是熄灭状态。<br><br><span><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>潜行并右键点击营火会取消营火出生点。<br><br><span><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，在床上睡觉会覆盖营火出生点。<br><br><span><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，如果重生时营火上方有方块被阻挡，该模组会破坏这些方块以创造空间。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，每当设置新的营火出生点时，会向玩家发送一条消息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，每当取消营火出生点时，会向玩家发送一条消息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，每当重生时营火出生点缺失时，会向玩家发送一条消息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 true<br>启用后，每当营火出生点被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 覆盖时，会向玩家发送一条消息。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认为 10000，最小 0，最大 3600000<br>玩家在营火处重生时获得的防火效果持续时间（毫秒）。值为 0 将禁用此功能，并将玩家放置在营火旁边。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>放置并破坏营火，以设置和取消出生点：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>在营火上放置泥土以将其熄灭：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>在营火处重生：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>从下界重生回下界的营火处：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>从主世界重生到下界的营火处：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>使用打火石点燃营火以去除其含水状态：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载文件仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模组的概览与更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
